      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOSTLY SAVAGE (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with seven wins and nine minors from 19 tries. In the money last time at this track (17.55) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 3 length third. With a clean break looks hard to beat. FIREBALL ZED (1) showed good pace from out wide and was prominent early but began to paddle and faded out of it when 6th at this track in Free For All company. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. TOMMIE'S BRIDE (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.25 beating Lakota Courtney. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. WATCH HER WIN (5) is a last-start placegetter in a fast-run race - should be thereabouts.",
